        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s1"
      },
      "text": "Link to previous attack campaign Unit 42 previously identified an Elirks variant during our analysis of the attack campaign called Scarlet Mimic.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_9",
